    "collapsible_content_faq_wrist": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_wrist_1": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Will It Pull Or Tangle My Hair?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Not when used correctly. The soft silicone massage heads are designed to glide gently over your scalp without pulling or tugging. For the best experience, move the massager slowly and avoid pressing down too firmly.<br/><br/><br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_wrist_2": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Can I Use It On Wet And Dry Hair?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! The massager is designed for both wet and dry use. Enjoy a relaxing massage on dry hair or use it during your hair care routine for an even more soothing experience.<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_wrist_3": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "How Often Should I Use It?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Most customers enjoy using it for <strong>5–10 minutes per session</strong>, several times a week. You can also use it daily as part of your self-care or relaxation routine.<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_wrist_4": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Is It Rechargeable?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. It features a rechargeable cordless design, so you can enjoy a relaxing scalp massage without being limited by wires. Simply recharge it when needed and it's ready for your next session.<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_wrist_5": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Who Is This Scalp Massager Best For?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>It's perfect for anyone looking to unwind after a long day, upgrade their hair care routine, or enjoy a relaxing at-home head spa experience. <br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_wrist_6": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "How Do I Clean The Massager?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>After each use, wipe the massage heads with a soft damp cloth and allow them to dry before storing. Regular cleaning helps keep your device fresh and ready for everyday use.<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_wrist_7": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "What if I'm not happy with the product?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>We offer a 90-day money-back guarantee. If you use it consistently and are not satisfied with your experience for any reason, reach out to our team and we will make it right — no questions asked.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
